{"articleNo":"1592","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1592&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 신입생 등록금 환불 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.02.07","hit":"13484","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">□ 2011학년도 신입생 등록금 환불 안내 □</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 환불 기간：</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">2011. 02. 08(화) ～ 21(월) 18:00</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">까지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 환불 금액：등록금 전액 환불</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 환불 신청 방법 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 인터넷 웹 환불 신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(1) 인터넷 접속 또는 홈페이지 등록금 환불 배너 클릭 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #000099; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #800080; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><a href=\"http://srs.jinhak.com/Refund/Login.aspx?Code=KSJOLXNJUE\" target=\"_blank\">http://srs.jinhak.com/Refund/Login.aspx?Code=KSJOLXNJUE</a></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(2) 등록포기 유의사항 확인 후 이름과 주민번호, 수험번호(접수번호)를 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;입력 후 ‘로그인’</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(3) 학생정보 확인.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(4) SMS 또는 E-mail 선택 → 발송 → 인증번호 입력 → 확인</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(5) 등록포기신청 인증하기 동의</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(6) 등록포기 금액 확인 후 포기사유 및 환불은행․계좌번호, 예금주 입력 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(7) 등록포기 완료</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(8) 등록포기 접수 및 처리 → 지정 계좌로 등록금 환불 완료</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 28.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -28.2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 환불신청 결과는 지정 계좌로 환불 조치 후 문자메세지로 처리 결과를&nbsp;<br>전송하여 드립니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;5. 등록금 환불 즉시 불합격 처리되며, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">환불 이후 절대 변경할 수 없음</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
